{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/6a0a2187cbdb89beb0e36436d8c8f97d.poster.avif?t=1766975221\" width=1138 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/6a0a2187cbdb89beb0e36436d8c8f97d.webm?t=1766975221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/6a0a2187cbdb89beb0e36436d8c8f97d.mp4?t=1766975221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a nightmarish world, a girl accidentally falls while holding her beloved pillow, discovering another girl who is remarkably similar to her, also trapped within. This girl possesses powerful abilities, seemingly capable of manipulating time and space. Amazingly, the girl can also use her pillow to defend against attacks in this world and even launch strong counterattacks. Together, they embark on an adventure to rescue their companions, uncover the truth, and dream of escaping this unknown dream...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2726Dual Combat Setting</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lisa:</strong> Dressed in a dark dress, clutching her beloved pillow, she appears delicate but possesses excellent defensive abilities. She serves as the supporter in the team, absorbing damage and ensuring the safety of her companions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mona</strong>\uff1aDressed in a light-colored dress with messy long hair, she has a passive yet aggressive personality, representing a strong sense of self-awareness. She is highly talented in attack and can swiftly counterattack enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2726<strong>Core Gameplay Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1.Badge Combination Combat System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players collect and combine various &quot;ability badges&quot; to trigger unique combat effects through free pairing. For example, the &quot;Life Conch&quot; increases the player's health; badges can also unlock skills, such as &quot;Wing Slash,&quot; allowing players to execute attacks like downward strikes, enabling them to adapt their strategies dynamically based on battlefield conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/4bfe699f63a6e7633895e414e94c0de7.poster.avif?t=1766975221\" width=1138 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/4bfe699f63a6e7633895e414e94c0de7.webm?t=1766975221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/4bfe699f63a6e7633895e414e94c0de7.mp4?t=1766975221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2.Exploration-Driven Growth and Narrative</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features &quot;layered open areas.&quot; Players explore dreamlike scenes such as &quot;Memory Ruins,&quot; &quot;Alien Realms,&quot; and &quot;Holy Corners&quot; to unlock fragmented storylines that reveal the protagonist's past of personality fragmentation and delve into the truth of near-death experiences connecting multiple dimensions. Additionally, during exploration, players can acquire new badges, upgrade materials, and interactive items, gradually enhancing their combat abilities and achieving a deep integration of &quot;exploration - growth - narrative.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/c0ef02890c0a905cc68e0e692dbe4f15.poster.avif?t=1766975221\" width=1138 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/c0ef02890c0a905cc68e0e692dbe4f15.webm?t=1766975221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/c0ef02890c0a905cc68e0e692dbe4f15.mp4?t=1766975221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3.Adventure Combining Parkour and Puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In key scenes, the game merges parkour with puzzle-solving elements. Players must evade traps on collapsing platforms, solve mechanisms to open pathways, and make precise jumps to reach hidden areas. This gameplay not only enhances the immersion and urgency of the scenes but also provides critical points for story progression, ensuring that the adventure is filled with both exhilarating mechanics and strategic depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/dd17a9db22985e31588bd7c3780553a3.poster.avif?t=1766975221\" width=1138 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/dd17a9db22985e31588bd7c3780553a3.webm?t=1766975221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/dd17a9db22985e31588bd7c3780553a3.mp4?t=1766975221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866890?t=1766975221","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/e01ecdf3dede096d2e41098265fb65d4d276527c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766975221","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/3530abff932e55a54663eba19d70dfaf09c1eebb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766975221","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/3530abff932e55a54663eba19d70dfaf09c1eebb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766975221","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3973130,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN US</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/32edd6319800a6dbb45ab52f5747f0b0.avif?t=1766975221\" width=800 height=220 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/6a0a2187cbdb89beb0e36436d8c8f97d.poster.avif?t=1766975221\" width=1138 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/6a0a2187cbdb89beb0e36436d8c8f97d.webm?t=1766975221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic