\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/4bfe699f63a6e7633895e414e94c0de7.poster.avif?t=1766975221\" width=1138 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/4bfe699f63a6e7633895e414e94c0de7.webm?t=1766975221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/4bfe699f63a6e7633895e414e94c0de7.mp4?t=1766975221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2.Exploration-Driven Growth and Narrative</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features &quot;layered open areas.&quot; Players explore dreamlike scenes such as &quot;Memory Ruins,&quot; &quot;Alien Realms,&quot; and &quot;Holy Corners&quot; to unlock fragmented storylines that reveal the protagonist's past of personality fragmentation and delve into the truth of near-death experiences connecting multiple dimensions. Additionally, during exploration, players can acquire new badges, upgrade materials, and interactive items, gradually enhancing their combat abilities and achieving a deep integration of &quot;exploration - growth - narrative.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/c0ef02890c0a905cc68e0e692dbe4f15.poster.avif?t=1766975221\" width=1138 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/c0ef02890c0a905cc68e0e692dbe4f15.webm?t=1766975221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/c0ef02890c0a905cc68e0e692dbe4f15.mp4?t=1766975221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3.Adventure Combining Parkour and Puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In key scenes, the game merges parkour with puzzle-solving elements. Players must evade traps on collapsing platforms, solve mechanisms to open pathways, and make precise jumps to reach hidden areas. This gameplay not only enhances the immersion and urgency of the scenes but also provides critical points for story progression, ensuring that the adventure is filled with both exhilarating mechanics and strategic depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/dd17a9db22985e31588bd7c3780553a3.poster.avif?t=1766975221\" width=1138 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/dd17a9db22985e31588bd7c3780553a3.webm?t=1766975221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/dd17a9db22985e31588bd7c3780553a3.mp4?t=1766975221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Hidden Level "],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/d4fc975f64a5394071c517e793e7d10c1f598e06/header.jpg?t=1766975221","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3866890/3407934/385b230bee65f0c65c52cd8d00b33e05367f00c8/1756085830/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756110314","dash_h26